---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro'; import WhatsAppForm from '../../components/WhatsAppForm.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="CV Preparation & Review"><header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Student Support',href:'/student-support/'},{label:'CV Support'}]} /><p class="eyebrow">Academic CV</p><h1>University ও scholarship-এর জন্য focused CV</h1><p class="lead">Relevant education, project, research, experience ও achievement conciseভাবে সাজাতে preparation এবং review support।</p></div></header><section class="section"><div class="container grid grid-2" style="align-items:start"><div><h2>একটি ভালো application CV</h2><ul class="clean-list"><li>Target অনুযায়ী relevant content priority দেয়</li><li>দায়িত্ব নয়, evidence ও outcome দেখায়</li><li>Clear heading ও consistent formatting ব্যবহার করে</li><li>Unsupported claim ও unnecessary personal details বাদ দেয়</li></ul><p class="notice">Public website-এ sensitive document upload করবেন না। WhatsApp discussion-এর পর নিরাপদভাবে document sharing পদ্ধতি ঠিক করুন।</p></div><WhatsAppForm kind="cv" title="CV support request" /></div></section></BaseLayout>
